 ;; -- CONTROLS -----------------------------------------------------------
 ;; OUTSIDE this repository's subject matter and cited for NO proposition.
 ;; They exist so that the repeal, revision and identity checks are checks
 ;; rather than constants. Removing one does not weaken a citation; it turns
 ;; the check that depended on it into something that cannot fail.

