  :law/id "999AC0000000999"
  :control/expect-status 200
  :control/expect-total-count 0
  :source/verify :verify/fabricated-id
  :source/covers
  "Not a law. Holds live the fact that the listing endpoint answers a
   fabricated id with 200 -- the reason no check here reads its status. If
   this ever 404s, the header is stale and this fails loudly."}

